cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus, please cite it."
title: "etalon: a known-answer recall corpus for constant-time analysers"
abstract: >-
  Deployed timing side-channel leaks reproduced as vulnerable and patched builds,
  each carrying a key recovery whose output verifies under a published public key,
  so that constant-time analysers can be scored against labels no analyser
  produced.
type: software
license: MIT
